  <para style="h">1 Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete rya mbere Pawulo yandikiye Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete rya mbere Pawulo yandikiye</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Jewe Pawulo, intumwa ya Kristo Yesu ku bw’ugushaka kw’Imana yo Mukiza wacu, na Kristo Yesu we vyizigiro vyacu,<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Ndakwandikiye Timoteyo umwana wanje vy’ukuri mu kwizera:</para>
  <para style="po" vid="1TI 1:2">Ubuntu, imbabazi n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data wa twese, no ku Mwami wacu Kristo Yesu bibane na we.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwirinda inyigisho z’ibinyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Igihe naja i Makedoniya nagusavye ko woguma muri Efeso kugira ngo uteshe abigisha inyigisho z’ibinyoma ntibasubire kuzigisha, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />canke ngo bateshe umwanya abantu mu vy’imigani myinshi n’urukurikirane rudahera rwa ba sekuruza. Ivyo bizana impari, aho gufasha mu gikorwa c’Imana co gukiza, twamenye biciye mu kwizera. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Intumbero y’inyigisho ni ukugira ngo abizera buzure urukundo ruva mu mitima itunganye, itarimwo ijwi ribagiriza ikibi, bafise ukwizera kuzima. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Ivyo bamwe barabihushije, baja mu mpari zitagira ikimazi. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Bagomba kwigira abigisha bubashwe b’ivyagezwe, ariko ntibatahura ivyo bavuga naho babikora bashize amanga rwose.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Turazi ko ivyagezwe ari vyiza iyo umuntu abikoresheje neza. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Kandi turazi ko ivyagezwe bitashiriweho abagororotsi, ariko vyashiriweho abarenga amategeko, abagarariji, abatubaha Imana n’abanyavyaha, abiyanduza n’abadasonera ivy’Imana canke ivyejejwe, abica ba se canke ba nyina, abicanyi muri rusangi, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />abasambanyi b’uburyo bwose, abasambana n’abafise ibitsina bisa n’ivyabo, abadandaza abagurano, ababeshi, abarahira nabi, canke abakora ibindi vyose bidahwanye n’inyigisho z’ukuri <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />ziri mu Butumwa Bwiza buvuga ubwiza bw’Imana ibereye guhezagirwa, ubwo najejwe.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubuntu Pawulo yagiriwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Ndashimira Umwami wacu Kristo Yesu, we yampaye inkomezi zo gukora igikorwa ciwe, kandi ko yabonye ko ndi uwo kwizigirwa, akanzeza ibikorwa vyiwe. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Naho nabanje kumutuka, ngahama Ishengero ryiwe, nkaba inkozi y’ikibi, naragiriwe imbabazi kuko nabikora mu kutamenya, kubwo kutizera. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu bwansutsweko bugwiriye, nuzura ukwizera n’urukundo biri muri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Iri jambo ni iryo kwizigirwa, rikwiye kwakirwa n’abantu bose, rivuga ngo: Kristo Yesu yazanywe kw’isi no gukiza abanyavyaha, kandi muri abo mboneka ndi mubi kurusha bose. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Ariko Imana yangiriye ubuntu kugira ngo kuri jewe, umunyavyaha arusha abandi bose ububi, Kristo Yesu anyerekanireko ukwihangana kwiwe kutagira iherezo, kugira ngo bibere akarorero abandi bose ko bashobora kumwizera bakaronka ubuzima budahera. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Icubahiro n’ubwiza bibe ivy’Imana ihoraho, Umwami ahoraho, adapfa, ataboneka, we Mana imwe yonyene, ibihe bidashira. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timoteyo asubira kuzezwa igikorwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timoteyo, mwana wanje, izi ni zo mpanuro ndaguhaye, mfatiye ku majambo yigeze kukuvugishwako, kugira ngo niwazikurikiza uze ugwane intambara nziza, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />uzigamye neza ukwizera, ata jwi rikwagiriza mu mutima. Kuko bamwe baritaye n’ibigirankana, ukwizera kwabo kuba imburakimazi kumera nk’ubwato busavye. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Bamwe muri abo ni Humenayo na Alegizandere, abo nahaye Satani kugira ngo bibigishe kutongera gutuka Imana.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Uko bikwiye kugenda mu gihe co guhimbaza Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Ndakugira inama rero, imbere ya vyose, gusabira abantu bose, kubasengera, kubigingira wongera ushimira Imana ku bwa bo. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Usengere abami n’abari mu bibanza vyo gutegeka bose kugira ngo tubeho mu mahoro, dutekaniwe, mu kwubaha Imana kwose, no mu kutagira umugayo muri vyose. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Ibi ni vyo vyiza bishimisha Imana umukiza wacu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />kuko ishaka ko abantu bose bakizwa bagashika ku kumenya ukuri. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Kuko hari Imana imwe, hakaba n’umuhuza umwe hagati y’Imana n’abantu, uwo na we ni umuntu, Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />Yatanze ubuzima bwiwe nk’incungu ku bantu bose. Ubu ni bwo butumwa Imana yatanze igihe cayo kigeze. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Ni co gituma natowe nk’umuvuzi w’ubwo Butumwa nkongera nkaba intumwa, kugira ngo nigishe Abanyamahanga ivy’ukwizera n’ivy’ukuri. Mvuze ukuri sindengeje urugero.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Abantu hose, nshaka ko abagabo baho basenga badugije ibiganza vyera, bataratse, kandi batagira ibihari. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />N’abagore na bo ndashaka ko bambara mu buryo bubereye. Bambare bikwize kandi baberwe, ariko ntibarondere kwiyerekana bafatiye ku kugene bakora imishatsi, kwambara inzahabu, amabuye y’agaciro canke impuzu z’igiciro kinini. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Ariko bashazishe ibikorwa vyiza, kuko ni vyo bibereye abagore bavuga ko bubaha Imana.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Abagore baze bige banumye, kandi berekana ukwubaha gukwiye. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Singomba ko abagore bigisha abagabo canke ngo babagirako ububasha. Nibumvirize banumye. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Kuko Adamu ari we yaremwe ubwa mbere, hanyuma haremwa Eva. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Kandi Adamu si we yahenzwe, umugore ni we yahenzwe, aca agwa mu caha. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Ariko abagore bazokirizwa mu kuvyara kwabo, nibaguma mu kwizera, mu rukundo, mu kwubaha Imana no mu kwicisha bugufi.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Uwukwiye kuba umurongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Iri jambo ni iryo kwizerwa: “Umuntu niyagomba kuba umurongozi w’Ishengero, azoba yipfuje igikorwa ciza.” <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Umurongozi akwiye kuba inyankamugayo, umugabo afise umugore umwe, atekereje, aganza ingeso ziwe, yubahwa, yakira abantu, kandi ashoboye kwigisha, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />atari imborerwa kandi adasinda, ariko afise ubugwaneza, adatera ibihari, kandi adakunda amahera. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Ategerezwa kuba uwushobora gutunganya urugo rwiwe, abana biwe bakamugamburukira kandi bakamusonera. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />(Kuko uwudashoboye gutunganya urugo rwiwe, mbega yoshobora gutunganya Ishengero ry’Imana gute?) <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Ategerezwa kuba atari umwana mu kwizera, ahandi ho yohava agwa mu caha c’ukwishira hejuru, akazocirirwa urubanza rumwe na Satani. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Ategerezwa kandi kuba avugwa neza n’abo hanze, kugira ngo ntagwe mu mugayo no mu mutego wa Satani.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />N’abadiyakoni na bo ni uko nyene, bategerezwa kuba ari abantu bubashwe, b’imvugakuri, batavuga bongera bivuguruza, bataborerwa, kandi batirukira inyungu mbi. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Bategerezwa kandi kuba bazigamye neza ukuri kw’ukwizera, badafise ijwi ribagiriza mu mitima. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Bategerezwa kandi kubanza gusuzumwa, basanzwe ata mugayo, baheze bashirwe muri ico gikorwa c’ubudiyakoni.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Abagore na bo nyene bategerezwa kuba ari abagore bubashwe, batavuga nabi abandi. Bategerezwa kuganza ingeso zabo kandi bakaba abizigirwa muri vyose.<verse eid="1TI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Umudiyakoni ategerezwa kuba umugabo afise umugore umwe, kandi ashoboye gutunganya abana biwe n’urugo rwiwe. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Abadiyakoni bazoba bakoze neza ibikorwa vyabo bazohabwa icubahiro, bazogira ugushira amanga mu kwizera bafise muri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igituma Pawulo amubwira ivyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Naho nizeye ko ndi mukuza kukuraba vuba, ivyo ndabikwandikiye kugira ngo, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />bishitse ngateba, abantu babe baramenya uko bakwiye kwigenza mu nzu y’Imana, aho Ishengero ry’Imana nzima rikoranira. Ni ryo nkingi n’urufatiro bishigikiye ukuri. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Ikirengeye ibintu vyose, umuntu yokwibaza, n’uko ibanga ry’ukwizera kwacu rihambaye cane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kristo yabonetse afise umubiri w’umuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">yemezwa na Mpwemu Yera kw’ari intungane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">abonwa n’abamarayika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">amenyekanishwa mu mahanga yose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">yizerwa n’abo mw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">maze aduzwa mu bwiza bwo mw’ijuru.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Mpwemu Yera abivuga atomoye ko mu misi yo mw’iherezo ry’ibihe abantu bamwe bazova mu kwizera kwabo bakurikire impwemu zibesha n’inyigisho ziva ku badayimoni. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Izo nyigisho zizoba zitangwa n’ababeshi bakaba n’indyarya, agatimanama kabo kamaze gupfa. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Bazoba babuza abantu kurongora, no kutarya imfungurwa zimwezimwe, izo Imana yaremye kugira ngo abizeye bakamenya ukuri bazifungure bashima. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Kubera ko ivyo Imana yaremye vyose ari vyiza ata gikwiye gutabwa, ahubo dukwiye kuvyakira dushima, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />kuko tuzi ko vyezwa n’ijambo ry’Imana n’amasengesho.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ivyo niwabishikiriza bene Data, uzoba uri umukozi mwiza wa Kristo Yesu, yagaburiwe ubutumwa bw’ukwizera yakira n’inyigisho nziza. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Wirinde impari ziva ku kutubaha Imana hamwe n’imigani y’abakecuru. Ahubwo wimenyereze kwubaha Imana. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Ukwimenyereza kw’umubiri ni kwiza, ariko ukwimenyereza kwubaha Imana ni kwiza gusumba, kugira ikimazi muri ubu buzima no mu buzoza. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Iri jambo ni iry’ukuri, kandi ni iryo kwizigirwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Igituma dukora tukaruha, ni uko twizera Imana nzima, yo Mukiza w’abantu bose, na canecane w’abizera.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Uze wame wigisha ivyo. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Ntihagire uwukugaya kubera ukiri muto, ahubwo ubere akarorero abizera: mu mvugo, mu buryo ubayeho, mu rukundo, mu kwizera, no mu kwezwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Mu kurindira ko ndagushikira, witange mu gusomera abantu Ivyanditswe, kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza no kwigisha. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Ntufate minenegwe ingabire yawe, iyo wahawe biciye mu kuvugishwa, igihe warambikwako ibiganza n’abarongozi b’Ishengero.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Ugire umwete muri ivyo. Witangire igikorwa cawe n’umutima wawe wose, ni ho bose bazobona ugutera imbere kwawe. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Wame wiyubara ku buzima bwawe, no ku vyo wigisha. Ubigiremwo umwete, ni ho uzokiza ubuzima bwawe n’ubw’abakwumva.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyerekeye Abapfakazi, Abageze mu zabukuru n’Abaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Ntugakankamire umutama, ariko umuhanure umwubashe nk’aho ari so. Abakiri bato ubafate nk’abo muvukana, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />abatamakazi ubafate nk’abavyeyi bawe, abagore bakiri bato ubafate nka bashiki bawe, kandi ubikore mu kwera kwose.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Witeho abapfakazi batagira uwubaraba. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Ariko umupfakazi afise abana n’abuzukuru, bakwiye kubanza kwitwararika uwo muvyeyi, ni ho bazoba bamwishuye ivyo yabakoreye, kandi ivyo birahimbara Imana. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Umupfakazi atagira umuntu n’umwe amufasha, asigaye ari wenyene, ashira ivyizigiro vyiwe ku Mana, akama ayisenga ijoro n’umurango kugira ngo imufashe. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Ariko umupfakazi abayeho yinezereza gusa aba yarapfuye mu mpwemu n’aho yoba ari muzima mu mubiri. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Ivyo uzokwame uvyibutsa abantu, kugira ngo babeho batagira umugayo. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Umuntu n’atafasha umuryango wiwe na canecane abo mu nzu yiwe, aba yihakanye ukwizera kw’ukuri, kandi uwo aba ari inyuma y’uwutizera.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Umupfakazi akwiye kuja ku rutonde rw’abafashwa akwiye kuba arenza imyaka mirongo itandatu, akaba yarabaye umwizigirwa ku mugabo wiwe, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />kandi akaba ashingirwa intahe ku bw’ibikorwa vyiwe vyiza nko kurera neza abana, kwakira neza ingenzi i muhira iwe, kwoza ibirenge vy’abera, gufasha abari mu ngorane, ndetse akaba yariyeguriye gukora ibikorwa vyiza vy’ubwoko bwose.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Na yo abapfakaye bakiri bato, ntuzobashire kuri urwo rutonde. Kuko ukwipfuza kw’imibiri yabo kwohava kubarengera bakava mu kwiyegurira Kristo bakagomba kwongera kurongorwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Gutyo bakaba bikwegeye gutsindwa n’urubanza kuko baba barenze kw’isezerano ryabo rya mbere. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Ikindi ni uko bashobora kuba ibinebwe, bakama bayerera inzu ku nzu bavuga urusaku, bita mu bitabaraba bongera bavuga ivyo badakwiye kuvuga. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Nico gituma nipfuza ko abapfakazi bakiri bato basubira kurongorwa, bakavyara abana, bagatunganya ingo zabo. Ni ho umwansi wacu atazoronka ico abarega. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Mbere n’ubu bamwe muri bo baza baramaze guta umurongo bakurikira Satani.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Nimba hari umugore yizera atunze abapfakazi mu nzu iwe, nabe ari we abafasha ntibaremere Ishengero, ribone ingene rifasha abatagira uwubafasha n’umwe.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Abakuru b’Ishengero barirongoye neza bakwiye kwubahwa no guhabwa ibibatunga na canecane abakora igikorwa co kuvuga ubutumwa no kwigisha. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Kuko Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo: “Ntimuze muzibire umunwa w’inka iriko irasekura ingano,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Gusubiramwo 25:4</ref></char></char></note> kandi ngo: “Umukozi aberwa n’impembo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luka 10:7</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Ntuze wumvirize ibirego bivugwa ku mukuru wo mw’Ishengero, kiretse bizanywe n’abantu babiri canke batatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Ariko abakuru baguma mu vyaha, uzobihanize ku mugaragaro imbere y’Ishengero kugira ngo abandi na bo babone gutinya. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ndakwingingiye mu nyonga z’Imana na Kristo Yesu n’imbere y’abamarayika batoranijwe ngo ukurikize ivyo ndakubwiye vyose udasize na kimwe, kandi ntuze wigere urobanura abantu ku butoni.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Ntuze wihutire na rimwe kurambika ibiganza ku bantu, ngo usange wifatanije n’abantu mu vyaha vyabo. Wame wejejwe.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Ntusubire kwama unywa amazi yonyene, uje uranywa umuvinyu mukeya ku bw’ingorane ufise mu nda, ukama ugwaragurika.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Ivyaha vya bamwebamwe biribonekeza n’imbere y’uko bajanwa mu rubanza. Ariko hari n’abandi ivyaha vyabo bimenyekana vyaratevye. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Muri ubwo buryo nyene, n’ibikorwa vyiza ni gutyo. Ibikorwa vyiza vya bamwebamwe biragaragara, ariko n’ibikorerwa mw’ibanga umusi umwe bizoja ahabona.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Abari mu buja bamenye ko ba shebuja bakwiye icubahiro cose, kugira ngo izina ry’Imana n’inyigisho zacu ntibitukwe. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Kandi abafise ba shebuja bizera Imana, nta mvo n’imwe yo kutabubaha kubera ko ari bene Data. Ahubwo bakwiye kurushirizaho kubakorera neza nka bene Data, kuko na bo bitaho ineza y’abo bari mu buja.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1TI 6:2">Ivy’abigisha b’ibinyoma n’abakunda amahera</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Ivyo bibe ari vyo uzohimiriza abantu. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Abigisha inyigisho zidahuye n’ivyo Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo yigishije ari vyo bizana ukugororoka, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />baba buzuye ubwibone n’ukwishira hejuru n’ukubura ugutahura. Bafise impwemu yo kuvuga no guharira ku majambo. Ivyo nta kindi bizana atari ishari, ibihari, ibitutsi, ukwikekana, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />hamwe n’uguterana amajambo bikunda kuba hagati y’abantu bazimiye mu bwenge, bataye ukuri, kandi bigira abagororotsi kugira ngo bashike ku nyungu zabo mbi.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Ariko ukugororoka n’uguhazwa n’ivyo umuntu afise bigira ikimazi kinini cane. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Kukaba nka ko, nta co twazanye kw’isi kandi nta co tuzojana tuyivuyeko. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Iyo turonse ivyo turya n’ivyo twambara, biba bidukwiye. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Abafise inyota nyinshi yo gutunga barageragezwa hanyuma bakagwa mu mitego y’ivyipfuzo vy’ubupfu kandi bibabaza, bibatwara mu kwononekara no guhona. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Kuko ugukunda amahera ni wo muzi w’ibibi vyose. Bamwe bagize umwitwarariko mwinshi wo kuyaronka, maze bazimirira kure y’ukwizera kw’ukuri, bita mu bibahagarika imitima.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Impanuro ya nyuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Ariko wewe muntu w’Imana, hunga ivyo vyose, ukurikirane ukugororoka, ukwubaha Imana, ukwizera, urukundo, ukwihangana n’ubugwaneza. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Ugwane intambara y’ukwizera. Uzigame cane ubugingo budashira wahamagariwe, igihe wagira ukwatura kwiza imbere y’ivyabona vyinshi. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Kandi ndakwinginze imbere y’Imana, yo itanga ubuzima kuri bose, n’imbere ya Kristo Yesu yashinze intahe nziza imbere ya Pontiyo Pilato, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />ngo ukurikize ivyo ndakugeze, utagira umugayo gushika aho Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo azohishurirwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Kuko igihe gikwiye kigeze, Kristo azohishurwa avuye mw’ijuru, ahishuwe n’Imana nyaguhezagirwa, Imana nyene inganji, Umwami w’abami kandi Uwuganza abatware. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Niyo yonyene ifise ukudapfa, kandi iba mu muco ata muntu yoshobora kuwegera, iyo ata muntu n’umwe arayibona kandi ata wushobora kuyibona. Icubahiro n’ububasha bibe ivyayo ibihe bidashira. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Wigishe abafise ubutunzi bwo muri iyi si kutishira hejuru no kudashira ivyizigiro vyabo muri bwo, kuko butaramba. Ariko bizigire Imana yo iduha vyose nk’umusesekara kugira ngo bitunezereze. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Ubigishe gukoresha amahera yabo mu gukora ivyiza: bakwiye kuba abatunzi mu bikorwa vyiza, no mu gufasha abakene no mu kugira imitima yiteguriye gusangira ivyabo n’abandi. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Nibakora uko, bazoba bariko bariziganiriza ubutunzi ngo bubabere urufatiro rwiza rwa kazoza aho bazogira ubuzima nyakuri.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Ewe Timoteyo, uzigame neza ico wahawe. Wirinde ibiyago birimwo kutubaha Imana, n’impari zirimwo ubupfu hagati yawe n’abakurwanya biyita abanyabwenge kuko bidahwanye n’ukwizera. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Bamwe barataye ukwizera bakurikira ubwo bupfu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TI 6:21" />
  <para style="b" vid="1TI 6:21" />
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Ubuntu bubane namwe mwese.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>